Package: secubox-ai-gateway
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox AI Gateway — data-sovereignty router for AI requests
 Routes AI inference requests across the available backends with
 per-request policy enforcement (sovereignty constraints, cost caps,
 data-class rules). Tracks egress + redirects sensitive prompts to
 local backends.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the AI cluster:
  - secubox-ai-insights — ML-based threat detection.
  - secubox-localai — self-hosted LocalAI LLM runtime.
  - secubox-ollama — Ollama LLM runtime wrapper.
  - secubox-mcp-server — Model Context Protocol server.
